    "macOS does not pass S.M.A.R.T. commands through USB bridges and card readers without a third-party driver. If one (e.g. a SAT SMART driver) is installed, data appears here automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS leitet S.M.A.R.T.-Befehle ohne Treiber eines Drittanbieters nicht über USB-Brücken und Kartenleser weiter. Wenn ein solcher Treiber installiert ist (z. B. ein SAT-SMART-Treiber), erscheinen die Daten hier automatisch."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS does not pass S.M.A.R.T. commands through USB bridges and card readers without a third-party driver. If one (e.g. a SAT SMART driver) is installed, data appears here automatically."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS no transmite comandos S.M.A.R.T. a través de puentes USB y lectores de tarjetas sin un controlador de terceros. Si hay uno instalado (p. ej., un controlador SAT SMART), los datos aparecen aquí automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS ne transmet pas les commandes S.M.A.R.T. via les ponts USB et les lecteurs de cartes sans pilote tiers. Si un tel pilote est installé (p. ex. un pilote SAT SMART), les données apparaissent ici automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS non trasmette i comandi S.M.A.R.T. tramite bridge USB e lettori di schede senza un driver di terze parti. Se ne è installato uno (ad es. un driver SAT SMART), i dati appaiono qui automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS は、他社製ドライバなしでは USB ブリッジやカードリーダー経由で S.M.A.R.T. コマンドを送信しません。ドライバ（SAT SMART ドライバなど）がインストールされている場合は、データがここに自動的に表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS는 타사 드라이버 없이 USB 브리지와 카드 리더를 통해 S.M.A.R.T. 명령을 전달하지 않습니다. 드라이버(예: SAT SMART 드라이버)가 설치되어 있으면 여기에 데이터가 자동으로 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS não repassa comandos S.M.A.R.T. por pontes USB e leitores de cartão sem um driver de terceiros. Se houver um instalado (por exemplo, um driver SAT SMART), os dados aparecem aqui automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果没有第三方驱动程序，macOS 不会通过 USB 桥接器和读卡器传递 S.M.A.R.T. 命令。如果已安装此类驱动程序（例如 SAT SMART 驱动程序），数据会自动显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS recorded failed requests on this drive after all retries were exhausted (reads: %lld, writes: %lld)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS hat nach Ausschöpfen aller Wiederholungen fehlgeschlagene Anforderungen auf diesem Laufwerk aufgezeichnet (Lesen: %lld, Schreiben: %lld)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS recorded failed requests on this drive after all retries were exhausted (reads: %lld, writes: %lld)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS registró solicitudes fallidas en esta unidad tras agotar todos los reintentos (lecturas: %lld, escrituras: %lld)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS a enregistré des requêtes en échec sur ce disque après épuisement de toutes les tentatives (lectures : %lld, écritures : %lld)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS ha registrato richieste non riuscite su questa unità dopo aver esaurito tutti i tentativi (letture: %lld, scritture: %lld)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべてのリトライを使い切った後も、このドライブで失敗した要求を macOS が記録しました（読み取り：%lld、書き込み：%lld）。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 재시도를 소진한 후에도 macOS가 이 드라이브에서 실패한 요청을 기록했습니다(읽기: %lld, 쓰기: %lld)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS registrou solicitações com falha nesta unidade após esgotar todas as novas tentativas (leituras: %lld, gravações: %lld)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在用尽所有重试后，macOS 仍记录到此驱动器上的失败请求（读取：%lld，写入：%lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
